  {
   "id": "matematicas-2016-reserva-1-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el paralelogramo de vértices consecutivos \\(A\\), \\(B\\), \\(C\\) y \\(D\\) siendo \\(A(1,0,-1)\\), \\(B(3,2,1)\\) y \\(C(-7,1,5)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Determina las coordenadas del punto \\(D\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula el área del paralelogramo.",
     "(0,75 p.) Halla la ecuación general del plano que contiene al paralelogramo."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>En un paralelogramo \\(ABCD\\), \\(\\overrightarrow{AD}=\\overrightarrow{BC}\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los lados opuestos son paralelos e iguales y, al recorrerlos en el mismo sentido, son el mismo vector.</i>:</p>\\[D=A+\\overrightarrow{BC}=(1,0,-1)+(-10,-1,4)=(-9,-1,3)\\]<div class='res'>\\(D(-9,-1,3)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El área es el módulo del producto vectorial de dos lados concurrentes<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(|\\vec u\\times\\vec v|\\) es el área del paralelogramo de lados \\(\\vec u\\) y \\(\\vec v\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(2,2,2)\\qquad\\overrightarrow{AD}=(-10,-1,4)\\]\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AD}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\2&2&2\\\\-10&-1&4\\end{vmatrix}=(10,\\,-28,\\,18)\\]\\[\\text{Área}=\\sqrt{100+784+324}=\\sqrt{1208}=2\\sqrt{302}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-69,\"el\":30,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1,0,-1],[3,2,1],[-7,1,5],[-9,-1,3]],\"#fcd9a8\",\"#c2410c\"],[\"vec\",[1,0,-1],[3,2,1],\"#64748b\",\"\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[1,0,-1],[-9,-1,3],\"#64748b\",\"\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[1,0,-1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[3,2,1],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-7,1,5],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-9,-1,3],\"D\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 238' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m16r1a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m16r1a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m16r1a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m16r1a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='253.4,184.5 314.0,130.3 86.6,18.0 26.0,72.1' fill='#fcd9a8' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#c2410c' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='253.4' y1='184.5' x2='314.0' y2='130.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m16r1a4g)'/><line x1='253.4' y1='184.5' x2='26.0' y2='72.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m16r1a4g)'/><circle cx='253.4' cy='184.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='260.4' y='178.5' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='314.0' cy='130.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='321.0' y='124.3' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='86.6' cy='18.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='93.6' y='12.0' font-weight='700'>C</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='72.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='66.1' font-weight='700'>D</text><line x1='24' y1='208' x2='38.9' y2='210.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='41.2' y='215.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='208' x2='29.7' y2='200.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='28.7' y='201.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='208' x2='24.0' y2='194.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='193.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,230)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,230)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>Área \\(=2\\sqrt{302}\\approx34{,}756\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El vector normal es el del apartado b): \\((10,-28,18)\\parallel(5,-14,9)\\). El plano es de la forma \\(5x-14y+9z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(A(1,0,-1)\\): \\(5-9+D=0\\iff D=4\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(5x-14y+9z+4=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con \\(C\\): \\(-35-14+45+4=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "geom",
     "tipo": "vec",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "geom",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": "b"
    },
    {
