  {
   "id": "matematicas-2016-reserva-1-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función dada por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{2x}{(x^2+1)^2}\\). Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\), el eje de abscisas y las rectas \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=1\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>En \\([0,1]\\), \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{2x}{(x^2+1)^2}\\ge0\\) (se anula solo en \\(x=0\\)): el recinto está por encima del eje y el área es la integral.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 170' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='60.0,135.6 62.5,128.3 65.0,121.2 67.5,114.1 70.0,107.2 72.5,100.5 75.0,94.1 77.5,88.0 80.0,82.1 82.5,76.7 85.0,71.6 87.5,66.9 90.0,62.6 92.5,58.7 95.0,55.3 97.5,52.3 100.0,49.7 102.5,47.5 105.0,45.7 107.5,44.2 110.0,43.1 112.5,42.3 115.0,41.9 117.5,41.7 120.0,41.8 122.5,42.2 125.0,42.8 127.5,43.5 130.0,44.5 132.5,45.6 135.0,46.8 137.5,48.2 140.0,49.6 142.5,51.2 145.0,52.8 147.5,54.5 150.0,56.2 152.5,58.0 155.0,59.7 157.5,61.5 160.0,63.3 160.0,135.6 157.5,135.6 155.0,135.6 152.5,135.6 150.0,135.6 147.5,135.6 145.0,135.6 142.5,135.6 140.0,135.6 137.5,135.6 135.0,135.6 132.5,135.6 130.0,135.6 127.5,135.6 125.0,135.6 122.5,135.6 120.0,135.6 117.5,135.6 115.0,135.6 112.5,135.6 110.0,135.6 107.5,135.6 105.0,135.6 102.5,135.6 100.0,135.6 97.5,135.6 95.0,135.6 92.5,135.6 90.0,135.6 87.5,135.6 85.0,135.6 82.5,135.6 80.0,135.6 77.5,135.6 75.0,135.6 72.5,135.6 70.0,135.6 67.5,135.6 65.0,135.6 62.5,135.6 60.0,135.6' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='20.0,221.4 23.2,218.0 26.5,213.8 29.8,208.9 33.0,203.3 36.2,197.0 39.5,190.1 42.8,182.6 46.0,174.5 49.2,165.9 52.5,157.0 55.8,147.8 59.0,138.4 62.2,129.1 65.5,119.8 68.8,110.7 72.0,101.9 75.2,93.5 78.5,85.6 81.8,78.3 85.0,71.6 88.2,65.6 91.5,60.2 94.8,55.6 98.0,51.7 101.2,48.5 104.5,46.0 107.8,44.1 111.0,42.8 114.3,42.0 117.5,41.7 120.8,41.9 124.0,42.5 127.2,43.4 130.5,44.7 133.8,46.2 137.0,47.9 140.2,49.8 143.5,51.8 146.8,54.0 150.0,56.2 153.2,58.5 156.5,60.8 159.8,63.2 163.0,65.5 166.2,67.8 169.5,70.1 172.7,72.4 176.0,74.6 179.2,76.8 182.5,79.0 185.7,81.0 189.0,83.0 192.2,85.0 195.5,86.9 198.8,88.7 202.0,90.5 205.2,92.2 208.5,93.8 211.7,95.4 215.0,96.9 218.2,98.3 221.5,99.7 224.8,101.1 228.0,102.3 231.2,103.6 234.5,104.7 237.8,105.9 241.0,107.0 244.2,108.0 247.5,109.0 250.8,109.9 254.0,110.9 257.2,111.7 260.5,112.6 263.8,113.4 267.0,114.1 270.2,114.9 273.5,115.6 276.8,116.3 280.0,116.9' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='160.0' y1='135.6' x2='160.0' y2='63.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><text x='190.0' y='56.1' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>f(x) = 2x/(x²+1)²</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 135.6H294.0M60.0 164.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='160.0' y1='132.6' x2='160.0' y2='138.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='157.0' y='149.6' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='260.0' y1='132.6' x2='260.0' y2='138.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='257.0' y='149.6' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='57.0' y1='63.3' x2='63.0' y2='63.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='44.0' y='67.3' font-size='10'>0.5</text></svg></div><p>Es inmediata, del tipo \\(\\int u'u^{-2}\\,dx=-u^{-1}\\), con \\(u=x^2+1\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>\\((x^2+1)'=2x\\): el numerador es la derivada de la base.</i>:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^1\\frac{2x}{(x^2+1)^2}\\,dx=\\Bigl[-\\frac1{x^2+1}\\Bigr]_0^1=-\\frac12+1=\\frac12\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac12\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
