  {
   "id": "matematicas-2016-reserva-1-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el punto \\(P(1,0,-1)\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\) de ecuación \\(2x-y+z+1=0\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Halla el simétrico del punto \\(P\\) respecto del plano \\(\\pi\\).",
     "(1 p.) Determina la ecuación del plano que contiene al punto \\(P\\), es perpendicular al plano \\(\\pi\\) y es paralelo a la recta \\(\\begin{cases}x-2y=1\\\\z=3\\end{cases}\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Paso 1. Recta perpendicular al plano por el punto.</b> Como la recta \\(s\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\) son perpendiculares, el vector normal del plano es paralelo al vector director de la recta<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si la recta es perpendicular al plano, su dirección es la del vector normal del plano: por eso sirve \\(\\vec n\\) como vector director.</i>: \\(\\vec d=\\vec n=(2,\\ -1,\\ 1)\\). Pasa por \\(P(1,\\ 0,\\ -1)\\):</p>\\[s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=1+2t\\\\y=-t\\\\z=-1+t\\end{cases}\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(s\\) en \\(\\pi\\equiv 2x-y+z+1=0\\):</p>\\[2(1+2t)-(-t)+(-1+t)+1=0\\iff 6t+2=0\\iff t=-\\frac{1}{3}\\]\\[M\\left(\\frac{1}{3},\\ \\frac{1}{3},\\ -\\frac{4}{3}\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(P\\) y su simétrico \\(P'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{1+a}2=\\frac{1}{3},\\qquad\\frac{b}2=\\frac{1}{3},\\qquad\\frac{-1+c}2=-\\frac{4}{3}\\]\\[a=-\\frac{1}{3},\\qquad b=\\frac{2}{3},\\qquad c=-\\frac{5}{3}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":44,\"el\":24,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[0.399,1.195,-0.603],[-0.317,-0.236,-0.603],[0.268,-0.528,-2.064],[0.983,0.903,-2.064]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[0.268,-0.528,-2.064],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-0.567,0.783,-1.783],[1.233,-0.117,-0.883],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.233,-0.117,-0.883],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[1.2,-0.1,-0.9],[1.667,-0.333,-0.667],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[0.065,-0.203,-1.333],[0.532,-0.437,-1.1],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"line\",[0.513,0.244,-1.244],[0.415,0.047,-1.244],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.415,0.047,-1.244],[0.235,0.137,-1.333],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1.0,0.0,-1.0],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0.333,0.333,-1.333],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[-0.333,0.667,-1.667],\"P′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m16r1b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m16r1b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m16r1b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m16r1b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='247.7,86.7 188.1,18.0 119.1,177.3 178.7,246.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='123.1' y='177.3' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='289.6' y1='162.8' x2='77.2' y2='101.2' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='83.2' y='101.2' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='81.1' y1='102.4' x2='26.0' y2='86.4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m16r1b4d)'/><text x='30.0' y='82.4' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='161.0' y1='106.2' x2='106.0' y2='90.3' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m16r1b4n)'/><text x='110.0' y='86.3' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='162.2' y1='125.9' x2='154.0' y2='116.4' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='154.0' y1='116.4' x2='175.2' y2='122.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='104.7' cy='109.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='111.7' y='103.2' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='183.4' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='191.4' y='144.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><circle cx='262.1' cy='154.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='269.1' y='148.8' font-weight='700'>P′</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='12.9' y2='274.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='6.0' y='280.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='35.5' y2='274.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.5' y='280.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(P\\) respecto de \\(\\pi\\) es \\(P'\\left(-\\frac{1}{3},\\ \\frac{2}{3},\\ -\\frac{5}{3}\\right)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: al sustituir en el primer miembro del plano, \\(P\\) da \\(2\\) y \\(P'\\) da \\(-2\\): valores opuestos, así que están a la misma distancia y a lados distintos del plano ✓.</i></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Paso la recta a paramétricas: con \\(y=t\\), \\(x=1+2t\\), \\(z=3\\); su director es \\(\\vec u=(2,1,0)\\).</p><p>El plano buscado contiene a \\(\\vec u\\) (es paralelo a la recta) y al normal \\(\\vec n_\\pi=(2,-1,1)\\) (es perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\))<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si dos planos son perpendiculares, el vector normal de uno es paralelo al otro.</i>. Su normal:</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec n_\\pi\\times\\vec u=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\2&-1&1\\\\2&1&0\\end{vmatrix}=(-1,\\,2,\\,4)\\]<p>El plano es de la forma \\(-x+2y+4z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(P(1,0,-1)\\): \\(-1-4+D=0\\iff D=5\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":36,\"el\":36,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[0.145,-1.283,-0.572],[1.855,1.283,-1.428],[1.375,2.243,0.493],[-0.335,-0.323,1.348]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[1.375,2.243,0.493],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[0.145,-1.283,-0.572],[1.855,1.283,-1.428],[0.059,2.181,-2.326],[-1.652,-0.385,-1.471]],\"#fcd9a8\",\"#c2410c\"],[\"txt\",[0.059,2.181,-2.326],\"σ\",\"#c2410c\",4,0],[\"line\",[0.1,-1.35,-0.55],[1.9,1.35,-1.45],\"#64748b\",1.4,false],[\"vec\",[1,0,-1],[1.816,-0.408,-0.592],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[1,0,-1],[1.894,0.447,-1.0],\"#16a34a\",\"u\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[1,0,-1],\"P\",-14,12]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 358 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m16r1b4bn' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m16r1b4bd' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m16r1b4bg' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m16r1